ace":"பாணரொடு","parts":[{"text":"பாணர்","lemma":"pāṇar","gloss":"bards"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the bards"},{"surface":"ஒராங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஒராங்கு","lemma":"orāṅku","gloss":"together"}],"gloss":"together"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருவிருந்து","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"coming"},{"text":"விருந்து","lemma":"viruntu","gloss":"guests"}],"gloss":"arriving guests"},{"surface":"அயரும்","parts":[{"text":"அயரும்","lemma":"ayar","gloss":"serving/feasting"}],"gloss":"serving"},{"surface":"விருப்பினள்","parts":[{"text":"விருப்பு","lemma":"viruppu","gloss":"desire"},{"text":"இனள்","lemma":"iṉaḷ","gloss":"she who has"}],"gloss":"she who is desirous"},{"surface":"கிழவனும்","parts":[{"text":"கிழவன்","lemma":"kiḻavaṉ","gloss":"husband/lord"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the husband"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருஞ்சமம்","parts":[{"text":"அருஞ்சமம்","lemma":"அருஞ்சமம்","gloss":"difficult battle"}],"gloss":"difficult battle","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ததையத்","parts":[{"text":"ததையத்","lemma":"ததையத்","gloss":"to shatter"}],"gloss":"to shatter","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாக்கிப்","parts":[{"text":"தாக்கிப்","lemma":"தாக்கிப்","gloss":"having attacked"}],"gloss":"having attacked","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருஞ்சமத்து","parts":[{"text":"பெருஞ்சமத்து","lemma":"பெருஞ்சமத்து","gloss":"in the great battle"}],"gloss":"in the great battle","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அண்ணல்","parts":[{"text":"அண்ணல்","lemma":"aṇṇal","gloss":"majestic"}],"gloss":"majestic"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"அணிந்த","parts":[{"text":"அணிந்த","lemma":"aṇi","gloss":"adorned"}],"gloss":"adorned"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்செய்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"poṉ","gloss":"gold"},{"text":"செய்","lemma":"cey","gloss":"made"}],"gloss":"gold-made"},{"surface":"ஓடைப்","parts":[{"text":"ஓடைப்","lemma":"ஓடைப்","gloss":"forehead plate"}],"gloss":"forehead plate","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெரும்பரிசிலனே","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்பரிசிலனே","lemma":"பெரும்பரிசிலனே","gloss":"is the recipient of great gifts indeed"}],"gloss":"is the recipient of great gifts indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Of the wildcat with stealthy walk by the old fence of the village / fearing its dark enemy, the young female bird / trembling for its life, screaming and crying out / she who rose shaking the coop and the brushwood / by the small fire-light of the cotton-spinning woman / is calmed by the cock with a bright-flowered forehead / such is the dwelling in the difficult forest-defense. And the wife, / while the hunting boys, without going to distant lands, / of the short-legged monitor lizard with a hood-like fold, / the rich fat-infused curd-surfaced porridge, / these fresh good things, together with the bards, / is desirous of serving to the arriving guests. And the husband, / attacking so that the difficult battle shatters, in the great battle, / adorned the majestic elephant / with a gold-made forehead plate, is the recipient of great gifts!","translation":"In the settlement surrounded by a dense, protective forest, a wildcat with a stealthy tread prowls near the old village fence. Fearing this enemy of the dark, a young hen trembles for her life, screaming and crying out. The cotton-spinning woman rises, shaking her coop and the brushwood fence, and in the dim light of her small fire, the hen is finally calmed by the cock with the bright-red comb on his forehead. In this very home, the wife is eager to serve arriving guests and bards alike. Without having to travel to distant lands, her young boys hunt and bring back short-legged monitor lizards with thick, fleshy tails. She cooks a rich porridge mixed with thick curds and the luscious fat of the lizard. Meanwhile, her husband, who charged fiercely to shatter the enemy's difficult front, has won great gifts in the grand battle—including majestic elephants adorned with forehead plates of pure gold!","modern":"ஊரின் பழைய வேலிக்கு அருகில் மெதுவாக நடந்து வரும் காட்டுப்பூனைக்கு அஞ்சி, இருளைப் பகையாகக் கருதி, ஒரு இளமையான பெண் கோழி தன் உயிருக்கு நடுங்கி அலறுகிறது. பருத்தி நூற்கும் பெண்மணி எழுந்து, கூடையையும் வேலியையும் தட்டி எழுப்பிய சிறிய விளக்கு வெளிச்சத்தில், சிவந்த கொண்டையையுடைய சேவல் அக்கோழியை அமைதிப்படுத்துகிறது. இத்தகைய அரிய காவற்காட்டை உடையது அந்த இல்லம். அங்குள்ள மனைவி, வேட்டையாடும் சிறுவர்கள் தொலைதூரத்திற்குச் செல்லாமல் அருகிலேயே பிடித்து வந்த குட்டைக் கால்களையும் தடித்த வாலையும் உடைய உடும்பின் கொழுப்பைச் சேர்த்து, தயிர் கலந்த கூழைச் சமைக்கிறாள். அந்தப் புதிய சுவையான உணவை பாணர்களுடனும் வரும் விருந்தினர்களுடனும் பகிர்ந்து உண்ண விரும்புகிறாள். அவளுடைய கணவனோ, அரிய போர்க்களத்தில் பகைவரைத் தாக்கி அழித்து, பெரும் போரில் வென்று, பொன்னால் செய்யப்பட்ட நெற்றிப்பட்டம் அணிந்த தலைசிறந்த யானைகளைப் பரிசாகப் பெறும் தகுதி படைத்தவனாக விளங்குகிறான்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai and the Mūtiṉ Mullai tuṟai, which celebrates the ancient, brave, and hospitable nature of warrior families. The poet describes a rustic, forest-guarded settlement where a domestic scene unfolds: a wildcat stalks a hen at night, causing a cotton-spinning woman to wake up and shake her coop, while the cock eventually calms the hen. In this same household, the wife is exceptionally generous, preparing a rich feast of curd-porridge mixed with the fat of monitor lizards caught nearby by her young sons. She eagerly serves this fresh meal to bards and arriving guests. Meanwhile, her husband is a fierce warrior who shatters enemy lines in battle and receives grand gifts, such as majestic elephants adorned with gold forehead plates. The contrast between the simple, rustic domesticity and the grand martial achievements highlights the noble character of the warrior's household.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.48],[1.53,1.94],[2.0,2.28],[2.28,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.